</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS7" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.1.7 </span>Further curriculum results</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A1.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ A.1.7 Further curriculum results ‣ A.1 Additional Experimental Details and Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Muonp: Muon with Fractional Spectral Powers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> shows additional Muon <math id="A1.SS1.SSS7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Muon<sup id="A1.SS1.SSS7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS7.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">p</span></sup> curriculum results for pretraining on Fineweb.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.13867v1/plots/curriculum.png" id="A1.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:191/210;" width="191" height="210" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="A1.F8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Muon <math id="A1.F8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> Muon<sup id="A1.F8.5.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="A1.F8.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">p</span></sup> curriculum when pretrained on Fineweb.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
